OL,3,ACelebrity shark guided out of South
OL,4,AKorea canal refuses to swim out to sea
OL,5,
OL,6,FA famed dusky shark in South Korea is
OL,7,Fcontinuing to linger near a canal that
OL,8,Fit was ejected from on Wednesday.
OL,10,FThe shark, nicknamed Bukangi, became an
OL,11,Funlikely sensation after it was spotted
OL,12,Fswimming in a canal in the
OL,13,Fsouth-eastern port city of Busan last
OL,14,Fmonth.
OL,16,FFor weeks, rescuers tried in vain to
OL,17,Fget her back to the open sea, using
OL,18,Fnets to guide it out.
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,315,300,200,140,0,100
